r, and the full board votes.\n\n**Shareholder ratification:** Section 32(a)(2) requires the selection to be submitted for shareholder ratification or rejection at the next annual meeting, if one is held. If the trust holds no annual meeting, because state law, its governing documents, or an applicable exemption doesn't require one, ratification may be omitted. The Statement of Additional Information and proxy materials disclose whether ratification is sought.\n\nConfirm the specifics against the trust's governing documents and current SEC rules, as I may not reflect the latest guidance.","ttft_ms":5610,"type":"result","duration_ms":6522,"uuid":"980df351-8e37-4566-a8c4-28c5fd3f7cd6","ttft_stream_ms":811,"time_to_request_ms":69,"first_content_frame_ms":812,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
